[[Beacon of Droknar|Beacons of Droknar]] function as [[resurrection shrine]]s in [[Eye of the North]] [[dungeon]] areas. In addition, they provide the [[Dwarven Raider]] [[blessing]] and each time you accumulate 25 kills you may talk to any beacon in the same area to receive a [[Dwarven_Raider#Bonuses|bonus]].

