== Dialogue ==
==== Not under [[Dwarven Raider]] ====
: ''"The beacon pulses and wavers as you approach, enveloping you in its embrace. You feel an electric charge run up your spine, through your fingertips, and across your weapon. You feel a call to arms against those who would defile this place!"''
{{ Offer dialog
| accept = They will die!
| decline = I must resist.
| ask = The light pulses and a cold wind blows silently past. Time to begin your hunt.
| accepticon = [[File:Dwarven Raider.jpg|20px]]
}}

==== Under Dwarven Raider ====
{{section-stub|Is there a dialogue higher? Based on the first three, next should be at 200, then maybe even 400.}}
;Less than 25 kills
: ''"You look into the light but sense a twinge of disappointment in its pulse. The counter reveals the number (0..24). This place is not yet clean of those who would defile it."''

;After 25 kills
: ''"The counter on the beacon's base glows and shimmers, revealing the number (25-49). The light pulses and you feel refreshed."''

;After 50 kills
: ''"The counter on the beacon's base glows and shimmers, revealing the number (50-99). The light flickers and your spirit is once again renewed."''

;After 100 kills
: ''"The counter on the beacon's base glows and shimmers, revealing the number (100+). The light glitters all around you, tickling your nose."''

==== After reaching Deldrimor rank 1, before receiving [[Stout-Hearted]] ====
: ''"Within the light of the beacon, you recognize a shimmering image. It is the Norn settlement of '''Gunnar's Hold'''. A Dwarf, '''Kodan [Dwarven Recruitment Officer]''', beckons you before fading from sight."''

==== Not under [[Veteran Dwarven Raider]] ====
: ''"As you step closer to the beacon, you are surrounded by a glittering aura of light. The beacon clearly recognizes you and is grateful for all that you have done."''
{{ Offer dialog
